	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg14218"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=361" title="View the profile of Toastie">Toastie</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 66<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.dc101.com/boards/images/avatars/54526468041b4c6960fc8c.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								10. Hasbeens<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=361"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.crimsontempest.info" title="Crimson Tempest" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg14218#msg14218"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg14218#msg14218">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1766 on:</b> February 03, 2005, 05:14:14 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">At a time when guilds are folding fairly quickly, the mere fact that some guilds are able to hold a raid force together, and complete new content is something special.&nbsp; Congratulations to any guild who is making forward progression these days, whether its DA/EiE, Conviction, RoS, Inner Loop, Brewmasters, League of Sozobon or any other guild.&nbsp; You&#039;ve survived where many others have fallen.</div>I’ll give you this to an extent... however, two things.<br /><br />1) Everquest, like it or not is a game about progression, the only reason to play is to <br />I’ll give you this to an extent... however, two things.<br /><br />1) Everquest, like it or not is a game about progression, the only reason to play is to progress, so to say its something special in its self that a guild is still progressing is silly.<br /><br />2) I could give two shits and a fuck less about conviction, da/eie or whoever, where their progression is etc.&nbsp; If you’re having fun playing EQ, doing whatever content you enjoy, then I’m happy for you.&nbsp; <br /><br />But...when you say shit like <br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote"> Cynosure and Kelekdrix down to Conviction on our very first attempts! More to come~<br /><br />/poke Grem</div><br />Its fucking retarded, for a few reasons...<br /><br />Grem, is and was a member of ascent.&nbsp; And by saying /poke grem, to me your essentially saying /poke ascent.&nbsp; I’ve never been in ascent, but I have a lot of friends who have been in the past.<br /><br />Now, your all gloating that you killed kelekdrix and cynosure.... cong you...<br /><br />But to be gloating to someone from Ascent, <i>who did that content when it was new</i> and by all accounts, when they did it where undisputedly one of the top 5 guilds in all of everquest, is plain ignorance.&nbsp; <br /><br />Sure, ascent has had its difficulties as of late, but any guild that has a substantial player base leave (i know from personal experience)&nbsp; is going to suffer the same fate.&nbsp; and the fact that your doing it <b>almost a year later</b> and gloating about it is retarded, and makes you sound like a total dickmitten, regardless of ascent&#039;s recent decline over the last few months.<br /><br /><br />p.s.&nbsp; who the fuck is mgram and why do i care what you think about me?
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg14219"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
