								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg14219#msg14219">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1767 on:</b> February 03, 2005, 05:27:34 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg14218#msg14218">Quote from: Toastie on February 03, 2005, 05:14:14 pm</a></div><div class="quote">I’ll give you this to an extent... however, two things.<br /><br />1) Everquest, like it or not is a game about progression, the only reason to play is to progress, so to say its something special in its self that a guild is still progressing is silly.<br /><br /></div><br />When most guilds are having to go backwards now to re-flag, forward progression can&#039;t be presumed.  Worse yet, some are stagnating on content, or struggling to gather raid forces.  That&#039;s what I&#039;m referring to.  Those that can continue to move forward are doing well.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg14218#msg14218">Quote from: Toastie on February 03, 2005, 05:14:14 pm</a></div><div class="quote">But...when you say shit like <br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote"> Cynosure and Kelekdrix down to Conviction on our very first attempts! More to come~<br /><br />/poke Grem</div><br />Its fucking retarded, for a few reasons...<br /><br />Grem, is and was a member of ascent.  And by saying /poke grem, to me your essentially saying /poke ascent.  I’ve never been in ascent, but I have a lot of friends who have been in the past. </div><br /><div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg13924#msg13924">Quote from: Grem on January 25, 2005, 01:41:32 pm</a></div><div class="quote"><br />ok well beat kelekdrix and CBQ and PG trials since we can, and do, do them on a daily basis<br /></div><br />My guess is... this is what the &quot;poke&quot; was about.  <br />&nbsp;<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
