							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">I&#039;m sure lots of people don&#039;t give a fuck about who progresses these days. Toastie just had the balls to say something.</div><br />ooo.... he had the balls to put down a guild&#039;s accomplishment and indicate he doesn&#039;t give a fuck about progression now in a thread about... guild progression.&nbsp; Wheee..... so hawt!&nbsp; So ballsy!&nbsp; If I swung that way, I&#039;d be in love! <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/inlove.gif" alt="inlove" border="0" />&nbsp; <br />/sarcasm<br /><br />No, that&#039;s just being an asshat.<br />
